{
  "id": "size-fixed-lot-loss-01",
  "title": {
    "en": "Fixed 1 Lot: A 40 Pip Stop Costs 400",
    "bn": "স্থির 1 lot: 40 pip stop মানে 400 লোকসান"
  },
  "symbol": "EURUSD",
  "timeframe": "H4",
  "mode": "synthetic",
  "type": "trade-setup",
  "bias": "bullish",
  "outcome": "loss",
  "tags": [
    "position-sizing",
    "fixed-lot",
    "mistake"
  ],
  "module": "08-risk-management",
  "lessonSlugs": [
    "02-position-sizing"
  ],
  "caption": {
    "en": "Same buy and same stop, but the trader used 1 lot out of habit. The stop hit at bar 49 and the loss is 4%, not 1%.",
    "bn": "একই buy ও একই stop, কিন্তু অভ্যাসে 1 lot নেওয়া হয়েছে। 49 নম্বর bar-এ stop লেগেছে, লোকসান 1% নয়, 4%।"
  },
  "notes": {
    "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
    "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
  },
  "explanation": {
    "en": "The stop distance was right. The lot size ignored it.",
    "bn": "Stop-এর দূরত্ব ঠিক ছিল। Lot সেটি উপেক্ষা করেছে।"
  },
  "keyTakeaways": [
    {
      "en": "A fixed lot turns every wide stop into a larger risk",
      "bn": "স্থির lot প্রতিটি বড় stop-কে বড় ঝুঁকিতে বদলে দেয়"
    }
  ],
